BU_: BCM CLUSTER ESP

BO_ 421 ESP_Status: 8 ESP
 SG_ WheelSpeedFL : 7|16@0+ (0.01,0) [0|655.35] "km/h" CLUSTER
 SG_ WheelSpeedFR : 23|16@0+ (0.01,0) [0|655.35] "km/h" CLUSTER
 SG_ YawRate : 39|16@0- (0.0001,0) [-3.2768|3.2767] "rad/s" CLUSTER
 SG_ EspActive : 55|1@0+ (1,0) [0|1] "" CLUSTER

BO_ 645 BCM_Command: 8 BCM
 SG_ SeatHeaterLevel : 7|3@0+ (1,0) [0|5] "" BCM
 SG_ MirrorFoldRequest : 4|1@0+ (1,0) [0|1] "" BCM
